## 🏗️ COMPONENT ARCHITECTURE FOR AGENTIC EXPERIENCE

### **Agent Swarm Dashboard Component**

```typescript
interface AgentSwarmDashboard {
  // Real-time status of all agents
  agentStatus: {
    dataExtractor: 'idle' | 'processing' | 'complete';
    biomarkerCalculator: 'idle' | 'processing' | 'complete';
    resistancePredictor: 'idle' | 'processing' | 'complete';
    drugRanker: 'idle' | 'processing' | 'complete';
    trialMatcher: 'idle' | 'processing' | 'complete';
    nutritionist: 'idle' | 'processing' | 'complete';
    carePlanner: 'idle' | 'processing' | 'complete';
  };

  // Live insights as they emerge
  liveInsights: LiveInsight[];

  // Active monitors
  monitors: {
    ca125: MonitorStatus;
    ctdna: MonitorStatus;
    imaging: MonitorStatus;
    labs: MonitorStatus;
  };

  // Event queue
  pendingEvents: AgentEvent[];
}
```

### **Event-Driven UI Updates**

```typescript
// Events trigger UI updates
const eventHandlers = {
  'biomarker_calculated': (data) => {
    updateMolecularProfile(data);
    showNotification('Biomarkers analyzed - TMB: ' + data.tmb);
  },

  'resistance_detected': (data) => {
    highlightResistanceSection();
    showUrgentAlert('Resistance signal detected');
    updateTreatmentOptions(data.alternatives);
  },

  'trial_match_found': (data) => {
    addTrialToDashboard(data.trial);
    showNotification('New trial match: ' + data.trial.nct_id);
  },

  'ca125_anomaly': (data) => {
    updateMonitoringSection(data);
    showAlert('CA-125 increased - schedule imaging');
  }
};
```

